{
  "total_duration": 619.337,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.92,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果一架老飞机掉在一个很远很远的小岛上，几十年没人碰它，会发生什么？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 6.27,
      "end": 8.85,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "你可能会想：它一定早就坏掉了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 9.2,
      "end": 15.2,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是这篇课文的惊喜就在这里：有一部分发动机反而被大自然保存得很好。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 15.55,
      "end": 20.39,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "保存它的不是博物馆，也不是工程师，而是一群蜜蜂。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 20.74,
      "end": 25.435,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天我们学一个故事："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "forgotten wreck, sweet surprise"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 25.785,
      "end": 28.705,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先看地点和时间。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 29.055,
      "end": 36.815,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：一九六三年，一架 Lancaster bomber 坠毁在南太平洋的偏远小岛 Wallis Island 上。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 37.165,
      "end": 43.097,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In 1963 a Lancaster bomber crashed on Wallis Island"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 43.447,
      "end": 52.711,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Wallis Island"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "在 South Pacific，离 Samoa 以西很远；你可以把它想成海中一个很不容易到达的小岛。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 53.061,
      "end": 63.94,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Lancaster bomber"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是一种旧英国战时飞机。我们只需要知道它后来有 aviation history value，不讲战争场面。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 64.29,
      "end": 72.538,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In 1963, a Lancaster bomber crashed, a remote place, in the South Pacific"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 72.888,
      "end": 76.368,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，时间一下跳到一九八九年。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 76.718,
      "end": 86.018,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：多年过去，事故被遗忘，残骸没有被打扰；后来航空勘查中，人们意外重新发现了它。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 86.368,
      "end": 91.244,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the crash was forgotten and the wreck remained undisturbed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 91.594,
      "end": 97.55,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "又说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the plane was accidentally rediscovered in an aerial survey of the island"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 97.899,
      "end": 106.003,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Aerial survey"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是从空中勘查。人们不一定是专门来找这架飞机，所以 accidentally 很重要。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 106.353,
      "end": 114.873,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "twenty-six years after the crash, accidentally rediscovered, an aerial survey, worth rescuing"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 115.223,
      "end": 119.503,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，旧飞机突然变成值得抢救的历史物件。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 119.853,
      "end": 127.333,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：到了那个时候，状态还算不错的 Lancaster bomber 已经很稀有，值得抢救。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 127.683,
      "end": 133.663,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a Lancaster bomber in reasonable condition was rare and worth rescuing"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 134.013,
      "end": 140.892,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "接着是安排别人来处理："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The French authorities had the plane packaged and moved in parts back to France"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 141.242,
      "end": 150.386,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "French authorities"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "简单理解为相关法国部门；他们安排专业人员把飞机拆分、包装、运回法国。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 150.736,
      "end": 158.12,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "reasonable condition, rare, worth rescuing, had the plane packaged and moved"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 158.47,
      "end": 161.75,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，标题的甜蜜笑点来了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 162.1,
      "end": 168.38,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：爱好者准备修复飞机，四台发动机里只有三台需要重修。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 168.73,
      "end": 173.558,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a group of enthusiasts are going to have the plane restored"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 173.908,
      "end": 178.255,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "又说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the group will need to have only three of them rebuilt"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 178.605,
      "end": 185.985,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "为什么 only three？因为第四台发动机被蜜蜂做成蜂房，蜂蜡把它保存得完好无损。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 186.335,
      "end": 194.487,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a colony of bees, turned the engine into a hive, totally preserved in beeswax, sweet as honey"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 194.837,
      "end": 199.001,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，为什么一架飞机会被忘掉二十六年？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 199.351,
      "end": 206.991,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "关键是 location。Wallis Island 很 remote，在 South Pacific，不像城市机场那样每天有人经过。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 207.341,
      "end": 211.697,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以 remote place 会让东西从大家的记忆里消失？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 212.046,
      "end": 218.446,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。The wreck remained undisturbed，不是因为它不重要，而是因为它太难被看见。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 218.796,
      "end": 222.442,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是它是 old bomber，为什么后来又值得抢救？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 222.792,
      "end": 229.512,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为 old 不等于 useless。有些物件 rare，而且保存状况 reasonable，就有 historical value。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 229.862,
      "end": 233.582,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Worth rescuing"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是值得抢救？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 233.931,
      "end": 237.851,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。它还没被修好，但是它 deserves the rescue。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 238.201,
      "end": 240.612,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那 aerial survey 是什么？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 240.962,
      "end": 250.242,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是从空中观察、拍摄、勘查。人们可能是在看岛上的地形，却 accidentally rediscovered the plane。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 250.591,
      "end": 255.121,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "蜂蜡真的能保存发动机吗？听起来像童话。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 255.471,
      "end": 262.591,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是魔法。Bees made a hive inside the engine, and beeswax helped protect it from damage and decay。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 262.941,
      "end": 267.643,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以标题"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Sweet as honey"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是双关？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 267.993,
      "end": 276.753,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Exactly. Literally, it connects to bees and honey. Figuratively, it is a sweet surprise after a long forgotten story。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 277.103,
      "end": 285.311,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In 1963 a Lancaster bomber crashed on Wallis Island, a remote place in the South Pacific, a long way west of Samoa."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 285.66,
      "end": 292.356,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The plane wasn't too badly damaged, but over the years, the crash was forgotten and the wreck remained undisturbed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 292.706,
      "end": 300.794,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Then in 1989, twenty-six years after the crash, the plane was accidentally rediscovered in an aerial survey of the island."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 301.144,
      "end": 306.808,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "By this time, a Lancaster bomber in reasonable condition was rare and worth rescuing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 307.158,
      "end": 311.934,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The French authorities had the plane packaged and moved in parts back to France."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 312.284,
      "end": 316.388,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Now a group of enthusiasts are going to have the plane restored."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 316.738,
      "end": 322.306,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It has four Rolls-Royce Merlin engines, but the group will need to have only three of them rebuilt."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 322.656,
      "end": 330.552,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Imagine their surprise and delight when they broke open the packing cases and found that the fourth engine was sweet as honey -- still in perfect condition."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 330.902,
      "end": 336.878,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A colony of bees had turned the engine into a hive and it was totally preserved in beeswax!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 337.228,
      "end": 340.027,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "remote"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一组词："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "remote"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 340.377,
      "end": 342.081,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "remote"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Remote"
        },
        {
